            "text": "The bucket Marketing holds 1,060,606.05 QFX, but it gives launchPercent 20% and no linearMonths, durationMonths or schedule for the rest, so 848,484.84 QFX is never released. This is a best practice of this tool, not a rule in EIP-20, the OpenZeppelin Contracts documentation or the Solana documentation. Fix: Make the steps of the schedule add up to the bucket exactly, or add linearMonths or durationMonths for the part after launch."
          },
          "locations": [
