          "message": {
            "text": "Trading starts at launch, but Liquidity and Public sale release nothing at launch, so there is nothing to trade or to pool. This is a best practice of this tool, not a rule in EIP-20, the OpenZeppelin Contracts documentation or the Solana documentation. Fix: Add a liquidity or public sale bucket with a part released at launch, or set tradingAtLaunch to false."
